The Substitute 2: School's Out is a action, mystery,
thriller film directed by Steven Pearl.

2
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:13,500
When teacher Randall Thomasson is killed during a carjacking, an unexpected visitor
shows up at his funeral - his estranged brother, Karl Thomasson.

3
